# ZHOU WEI Personal Brand Website - Design & Tech

## Core Identity
- **ZHOU WEI**: Crossover Explorer (Finance -> Yoga -> Entrepreneur)
- **Key Message**: "勇于挑战，从0到1，让改变如呼吸般简单。"

## Design Philosophy
- **Minimalist, Gentle, Fluid, and Breathable (极简温柔风)**.
- **Palette**: 
  - Warm Pearl White (`#F9F8F6`) - Background
  - Charcoal Gray (`#2D2D2D`) - Text
  - Sage Green (`#A3B18A`) - Accents
- **Typography**: 
  - Serif for headings (elegant)
  - Sans-serif for body (readable)
- **Feel**: Large border-radius (`rounded-4xl`), soft shadows, plenty of white space. No harsh lines.
- **Animations**: Slow transitions (`duration-700+`) with `ease-in-out` using `Framer Motion`.

## Tech Stack
- **Framework**: Next.js 14+ (App Router)
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS
- **Animation**: Framer Motion
- **Database**: Supabase (for "Insights")
- **Icons**: Lucide React
